            {
              "text": "The garden was full of lovely plants.",
              "audioStart": 15.222,
              "audioEnd": 17.375
            },
            {
              "text": "The children always felt very happy there.",
              "audioStart": 18.333,
              "audioEnd": 20.736
            },
            {
              "text": "They ran around the soft grass every single day.",
              "audioStart": 21.694,
              "audioEnd": 24.514
            },
            {
              "text": "They laughed and sang while the sun shone brightly above.",
              "audioStart": 25.472,
              "audioEnd": 28.528
            },
            {
              "text": "The flowers grew tall and sweet in the warm air.",
              "audioStart": 29.486,
              "audioEnd": 32.222
            },
            {
              "text": "Every single moment felt like a wonderful dream for them.",
              "audioStart": 33.181,
              "audioEnd": 36.375
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "One day, the man returned home from another country.",
              "audioStart": 37.333,
              "audioEnd": 40.5
            },
            {
              "text": "He was very bad when he saw children in his garden.",
              "audioStart": 41.458,
              "audioEnd": 44.319
            },
            {
              "text": "He spoke out high and clear to everyone.",
              "audioStart": 45.278,
              "audioEnd": 47.611
            },
            {
              "text": "He told them the place was for him only.",
              "audioStart": 48.569,
              "audioEnd": 50.792
            },
            {
              "text": "The man built a high wall around the garden.",
              "audioStart": 51.75,
              "audioEnd": 54.125
            },
            {
              "text": "He put up a big sign for all to see.",
              "audioStart": 55.083,
              "audioEnd": 57.347
            },
            {
              "text": "The poor children had no place else to play.",
              "audioStart": 58.306,
              "audioEnd": 60.958
            },
            {
              "text": "They felt very bad about the change.",
              "audioStart": 61.917,
              "audioEnd": 64.028
            },
            {
              "text": "Soon, the year changed.",
              "audioStart": 64.986,
              "audioEnd": 66.792
            },
            {
              "text": "An old time of cold air and white water covered everything.",
              "audioStart": 67.75,
              "audioEnd": 71.111
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "The cold wind moved through the trees day and night.",
              "audioStart": 72.069,
              "audioEnd": 74.708
            },
            {
              "text": "Water covered the ground day after day.",
              "audioStart": 75.667,
              "audioEnd": 77.875
            },
            {
              "text": "The man could not understand why the year never came back.",
              "audioStart": 78.833,
              "audioEnd": 82.042
            },
            {
              "text": "He sat by his window alone.",
              "audioStart": 83,
              "audioEnd": 84.778
            },
            {
              "text": "He felt very cold and sad.",
              "audioStart": 85.736,
              "audioEnd": 87.528
            },
            {
              "text": "Snow fell upon the high wall and the empty paths.",
              "audioStart": 88.486,
              "audioEnd": 91.431
            },
            {
              "text": "No little children came near his big house anymore.",
              "audioStart": 92.389,
              "audioEnd": 95.236
            },
            {
              "text": "He looked outside at the white ground for hours.",
              "audioStart": 96.194,
              "audioEnd": 98.889
            },
            {
              "text": "He wondered if spring would ever return to his home.",
              "audioStart": 99.847,
              "audioEnd": 102.542
            },
            {
              "text": "His heart felt heavy as the dark winter stayed.",
              "audioStart": 103.5,
              "audioEnd": 106.222
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "One morning, the children found a small opening in the wall.",
